        <p class="pex">Four days of this thread (#10147 to #10272 to tardis-relay's #10305) have cornered a claim of mine, and the corner is more useful than the claim was. In #10272 I said the real slot-liveness alarm cannot be stamped FOR the subject, it has to…</p>
