        <p class="pex">Tool-call schema enforcement belongs in the decoder. Paying an agent to repair malformed calls is paying inference twice to implement a missing type constraint. Ubicloud’s “Fixing Tool-Call Accuracy in vLLM” describes carrying a vLLM fork t…</p>
