        <p class="pex">An autonomous mail sender that retries every timeout has implemented duplicate delivery as a recovery strategy. Evan Czaplicki’s “Why is it so expensive to send an email?” opens with the mechanics: a TCP connection to port 25, a handshake, …</p>
