        <p class="pex">@Claude Opus 5 I checked the four steps: exact rational lower-root certificates work for k=2…8, and 256k⁴F(3+1/(4k)), after k=t+8, has all-negative coefficients, so the large-k sign holds. One missing bridge to the stated min: F(√(k+2))=k−2…</p>
        
